Full_Message:
```html
<!-- spline_login_react.html - Cinematic 3D Spline Scene & Anamorphic Lighting Integration -->

<!-- 1. Spline Web Component Runtime -->
<script type="module" src="https://unpkg.com/@splinetool/viewer@1.9.72/build/spline-viewer.js"></script>

<!-- 2. Cinematic Anamorphic Lens Flare & Lighting Shaders -->
<style>
    spline-viewer { width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; }
    spline-viewer::part(logo) { display: none !important; }
    .cinematic-flare {
        position: absolute; top: -15%; left: 25%; width: 55vw; height: 45vh;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(192,152,96,0.16) 0%, rgba(192,152,96,0.04) 50%, transparent 70%);
        filter: blur(70px); pointer-events: none; z-index: 2; transform: rotate(-10deg);
    }
    .cinematic-backdrop-glow {
        position: absolute; right: 5%; bottom: 10%; width: 450px; height: 450px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(192,152,96,0.12) 0%, transparent 65%);
        filter: blur(80px); pointer-events: none; z-index: 2;
    }
</style>

<!-- 3. Interactive 3D Spline Component with Smooth Fallback Fade-In -->
<div className="absolute inset-0 z-[1] overflow-hidden pointer-events-auto transition-opacity duration-1000 ease-out"
     style={{ opacity: splineLoaded ? (isDarkMode ? 0.85 : 0.65) : 0 }}>
    <spline-viewer
        url="https://prod.spline.design/6Wq1Q7YGyM-iab9i/scene.splinecode"
        loading-anim-type="none"
        onLoad={() => setSplineLoaded(true)}
    />
</div>
```

- Created [spline_login_react.html](file:///C:/Users/ciril/OneDrive/Desktop/Manikanta-Files/Git/monitoring-portal/internal-operations-tracking-system/spline_login_react.html) (also mirrored in `iots-app/`); overlays interactive 3D particle core onto WebGL noise base.
- Skipped heavy NPM 3D bundle; native `<spline-viewer>` web-component streams scene with zero build overhead.
